## 18. MANDATORY CROSS-APPLICATION AUTH COMPATIBILITY — PREVENT UNEXPECTED LOGOUT (2026-10-17 ADDENDUM)

These requirements apply to every protected Prudle app, whether HTML or React/Vite, including applications that work after login but redirect to login when a second app is opened.

